制与边界感\n炒股高手最核心的能力是风控：设止损、控仓位、不all in。这和健康DOM强调的“知情同意、安全词、强度分级、随时可停”在思维上高度同构——都是先划边界再行动，而不是上头就冲。\n\n2. 情绪稳定与延迟满足","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2117258853666709929"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-02T13:02:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117241043301306682"],"id":"2117241043301306682","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3044,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"在数学里，有一个美好的词，叫求和。也有个遗憾的词，叫无解。还有个霸气的词，叫有且仅有，当然，也有个悲伤的词，叫无限接近却永不相交。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2117241043301306682"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-02T09:07:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117181888255377860"],"id":"2117181888255377860","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5468,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2117176562118275512","type":"quoted"}],"text":"央行：为支持资本市场健康稳定发展，中国人民银行将于11月3日开展证券、基金、保险公司互换便利操作，互换期限1年，可视情展期。目前有31家证券、基金公司申报需求，申请额度超过1000亿元。 https://t.co/KraSDTXAgU","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2117181888255377860"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-02T08:46:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117176562118275512"],"id":"2117176562118275512","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":16169,"like_count":27,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":4},"text":"盘后出利好，中国人民银行将启动第三次证券、基金、保险公司互换便利操作招标。\n\n会议要求：","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2117176562118275512"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-02T04:06:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117106085136056645"],"id":"2117106085136056645","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5334,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"昨天给进过群的朋友们，发了一条很重要的朋友圈，等过几天再剖出来！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2117106085136056645"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-02T03:36:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["211709